   ],
   "html": "<p>To celebrate and promote visionary filmmaker Luca Guadagnino’s psychological drama After The Hunt, we brought together a handpicked group of creators, tastemakers, and film thought leaders for a special advanced screening and discussion moderated by hosts Tabitha Denholm, founder of Women Under the Influencer, and multimedia artist, Mandy Harris Williams </p>\n<p>The private event, complete with themed food and beverage, was captured for social content to promote the upcoming release, drive ticket sales, and spark online discussion.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "ARRIVAL & PRE-RECEPTION",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Guests were greeted at check-in and received black wristbands before being guided into the Boxwood Lounge for a private reception. Moody florals and carefully arranged old books decorated tables throughout the room, reflecting the film’s opening scene. Conversation cards were placed throughout to prompt discussion themes for the evening.</p>",
     "right": "<p>All who were invited enjoyed a sophisticated reception designed to spark conversation, accompanied by a classical soundtrack. Passed bites, including chicken satay and herb pancakes with smoked salmon, were paired with themed cocktails such as “The Professor.”</p>\n<p>‍</p>"
    },
    {
