  {
   "title": "SCREENING & DISCUSSION",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Before the screening, staff guided guests to the theater, where they grabbed popcorn and refreshments prior to seating. Once everyone was settled, Tabitha and Mandy provided a brief introduction, highlighting the line, “Not everything is supposed to make you comfortable.”</p>",
     "right": "<p>After the credits rolled, the moderators led the audience in a wider conversation, asking thought-provoking questions about the film’s themes and key ideas. To capture additional content, our team mic’d guests as they exited the screening, recording their raw reactions to both the film and the discussion.</p>"
